    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for pools of compiler re-entry trampolines. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>These trampolines are callable addresses that save all register state before calling a supplied function to return the trampoline landing address, then restore all state before jumping to that address. They are used by various ORC APIs to support lazy compilation </para>
    </detaileddescription>
